     9	   4.5:1 a chip's small text needs. These three are semantic and the theme
    10	   re-steps them — `--ns-money-neg` moves rust-6 to rust-4 in dark and the
    11	   tint/border pair steps 10/20% up to 12/24% — so one rule covers both
    12	   themes instead of a dark-mode override that drifts. */
    13	.ns-exception-badge[data-exception]:not([data-exception='none']) {
